# JRebirth boundaries

Always prefer mechanisms framework already provides over ad-hoc shortcuts

The following shortcuts banned default:

- no `new Thread` normal application flow
- no `Platform.runLater` used design pattern
- no heavy business logic placed inside View or Controller
- no stateful bindings owned View when belong Model
- no `localFacade().globalFacade()` except rare hard integration cases

Whenever doubt stop use relevant skill
